    "claims": [
      "Changes are drafted on a worksheet; the live BOM is untouched until applied",
      "Line-level change tracking and comparison with cost impact",
      "Multi-level approval with auto-approval below a threshold",
      "Approval delegation, mandatory rejection reasons and email notifications",
      "Multi-level explosion with bottom-up cost roll-up",
      "Where-used lookup across one or many BOM levels",
      "Change impact rated low, medium or high risk",
      "Revision history with snapshots, comparison and restore",
      "Tracks obsolescence with end-of-life and last-time-buy dates",
      "Mass component replacement across BOMs with cost preview",
      "Rule-based configurable BOMs with a wizard",
      "Imports BOMs from CAD/PDM exports in Excel, CSV, XML or JSON",
      "Import API for PLM, PDM or ERP systems; imports never overwrite certified BOMs",
      "Needs BC online 29.0 or later with Premium manufacturing",
      "Licensed per user in tiered plans"
